## Workaround

None available from the client side. The vulnerability exists at the server layer. Mitigation requires:

1. Adding an authentication guard to all `/services/bank/` REST endpoints — reject requests without a valid `JSESSIONID` with HTTP 401
2. Adding an authorization check — verify that the `customerId` or `accountId` in the request path belongs to the authenticated session's user before returning data

